---
// IsometricLayers.astro - 5-Layer Architectural Stack
---

<div class="rounded-xl border border-parchment-400 dark:border-obsidian-700 bg-white/70 dark:bg-obsidian-850/80 p-5 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm transition-all">
  <div class="border-b border-parchment-400 dark:border-obsidian-700 pb-3 mb-4">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-parchment-900 dark:text-obsidian-100 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>The 5 Architectural Layers</span>
        <span class="rounded bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400 text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 border border-indigo-500/20">Unified Truth</span>
      </h3>
      <span class="text-xs font-mono text-parchment-600 dark:text-obsidian-400">Same truth. Different views. One system.</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 gap-3">
    <!-- Layer 5: Receipts -->
    <div class="group relative rounded-lg border border-purple-300 dark:border-purple-800/60 bg-purple-500/5 hover:bg-purple-500/15 p-3.5 transition-all cursor-pointer">
      <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-400 uppercase font-bold mb-1">Layer 5</div>
      <div class="font-semibold text-sm text-parchment-900 dark:text-obsidian-100 mb-1">Receipts</div>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-parchment-700 dark:text-obsidian-400 leading-snug">
        <strong>What happened.</strong> Append-only log of every change, signed claims, and gate decisions.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-2 text-[10px] font-mono text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400">log/ & turns/*.yaml</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Layer 4: Timeline -->
    <div class="group relative rounded-lg border border-blue-300 dark:border-blue-800/60 bg-blue-500/5 hover:bg-blue-500/15 p-3.5 transition-all cursor-pointer">
      <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400 uppercase font-bold mb-1">Layer 4</div>
      <div class="font-semibold text-sm text-parchment-900 dark:text-obsidian-100 mb-1">Timeline</div>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-parchment-700 dark:text-obsidian-400 leading-snug">
        <strong>When it happened.</strong> 4D dial scrubber across turns. Restores features via 3-way merge.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-2 text-[10px] font-mono text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">afwe timeline restore</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Layer 3: Graph -->
    <div class="group relative rounded-lg border border-cyan-300 dark:border-cyan-800/60 bg-cyan-500/5 hover:bg-cyan-500/15 p-3.5 transition-all cursor-pointer">
      <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-400 uppercase font-bold mb-1">Layer 3</div>
      <div class="font-semibold text-sm text-parchment-900 dark:text-obsidian-100 mb-1">Graph</div>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-parchment-700 dark:text-obsidian-400 leading-snug">
        <strong>How it's connected.</strong> AST scene graph, directional dependencies, and geometric constraints.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-2 text-[10px] font-mono text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400">constraints.yaml</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Layer 2: Blueprint -->
    <div class="group relative rounded-lg border border-emerald-300 dark:border-emerald-800/60 bg-emerald-500/5 hover:bg-emerald-500/15 p-3.5 transition-all cursor-pointer">
      <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 uppercase font-bold mb-1">Layer 2</div>
      <div class="font-semibold text-sm text-parchment-900 dark:text-obsidian-100 mb-1">Blueprint</div>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-parchment-700 dark:text-obsidian-400 leading-snug">
        <strong>What it is.</strong> Nested parcels of subsystems and modules mapped to physical source files.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-2 text-[10px] font-mono text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">blueprint.yaml</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Layer 1: Features -->
    <div class="group relative rounded-lg border border-amber-300 dark:border-amber-800/60 bg-amber-500/5 hover:bg-amber-500/15 p-3.5 transition-all cursor-pointer">
      <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 uppercase font-bold mb-1">Layer 1</div>
      <div class="font-semibold text-sm text-parchment-900 dark:text-obsidian-100 mb-1">Features</div>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-parchment-700 dark:text-obsidian-400 leading-snug">
        <strong>Your product.</strong> User-facing capabilities, intents, and business deliverables.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-2 text-[10px] font-mono text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">intents/*.yaml</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
